0008: host capability `webview.underSurface` (on top of 0001, 0002, 0003, 0005, 0006, 0007).

`host.call("webview.underSurface")` resolves true when this host shows web views under GPUI's surface (patch 0005
on macOS, and `NSH_WEBVIEW_ABOVE` not set), false otherwise. A host without the patch rejects the call. The app asks
once (t3ui/components/rightPanel/nativeOcclusion.ts `detectWebViewsUnderSurface`) and then stops hiding web views
under its menus and dialogs. No conflict resolution was needed to combine the series: 0005 does not touch app.rs,
0006 and 0007 touch only app.rs.

Apply order at the root of `git archive e626a8d`: 0001, 0002, 0003, 0005, 0006, 0007, 0008 (`patch -p1`), then vendor
gpui-fast-apple 0.1.9 into vendor/gpui-fast-apple and apply 0005a inside it. 0004 is not part of this series.

